OL,3,ABurnham joined by former PMs at
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham was joined by former prime
OL,7,Fministers at a memorial service for the
OL,8,Flate politician Ann Widdecombe.
OL,10,FThe Service of Remembrance at
OL,11,FWestminster Cathedral was held on
OL,12,FThursday afternoon, with eulogies
OL,13,Fdelivered and a choir performance.
OL,15,FHundreds of guests attended, with David
OL,16,FCameron, Liz Truss, Boris Johnson and
OL,17,FRishi Sunak among them.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
