OL,3,ABurnham joined by former PMs at
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FBishop James Curry, the Auxiliary
OL,7,FBishop of Westminster, led the service
OL,8,Fafter the Archbishop of Westminster,
OL,9,FRichard Moth, was taken to hospital
OL,10,Fearlier.
